msgid "Usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc_readme.md:29
msgid "API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc_readme.md:31
msgid "alloc(size[, fill[, encoding]])"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc_readme.md:33
msgid "`size` &lt;Integer&gt; The desired length of the new `Buffer`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc_readme.md:34
msgid ""
"`fill` &lt;String&gt; | &lt;Buffer&gt; | &lt;Integer&gt; A value to pre-"
"fill the new `Buffer` with. **Default:** `0`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc_readme.md:35
msgid ""
"`encoding` &lt;String&gt; If `fill` is a string, this is its encoding. "
"**Default:** `'utf8'`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/buffer-alloc_readme.md:37
msgid ""
"Allocates a new `Buffer` of `size` bytes. If `fill` is `undefined`, the "
"`Buffer` will be zero-filled."
msgstr ""

